  published="2026-11-20"
  crumbs={[{ href: "/gta-6/", label: "GTA 6" }]}
  faq={faq}
  sources={[
    { href: "https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/strangers/search-for-tree-effigies", label: "GTABase: Search for Tree Effigies" },
    { href: "https://www.powerpyx.com/?p=372182", label: "PowerPyx: Search for Tree Effigies walkthrough" },
    { href: "https://www.powerpyx.com/?p=372183", label: "PowerPyx: Help Kirk Find Mr. Mangrove" },
  ]}
>
  <p><strong>Search for Tree Effigies</strong> is the second quest for Kirk, the Skunk Ape hunter. He wants photos of 3 carved tree effigies so he can work out where "Mr. Mangrove" is hiding. All three are inside the pink search circle he puts on your map, but they blend into the trees and are easy to walk past. Every screenshot below is from our own playthrough.</p>
  <div class="callout"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> all 3 are in Kirk's pink circle in the marshes between <strong>Watson Bay</strong> and <strong>Hamlet</strong>: one on a tree island near the middle, one alone in open grassland on the north side, and one in the mangroves on the north edge by the Pelican River. Hold <strong>L2 / LT</strong> to inspect each one. The quest ends when you've inspected all 3.</p></div>

  <h2>How to start it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Finish Kirk's first quest, <strong>Search for the Skunk Ape</strong>.</li>
    <li>Keep playing until Kirk texts you. It can take a while, so do other missions or side activities meanwhile.</li>
    <li>His text adds a large pink search circle over the marshes. You can play it as Jason or Lucia.</li>
  </ul>

  {effigies.map((e) => (
    <>
      <h2>{e.title}</h2>
      <p>{e.intro}</p>
      {e.shots.map((s) => (
        <figure style="margin:20px 0">
          <img src={s.src} alt={s.alt} width={s.w} height={s.h} loading={e.n === 1 ? "eager" : "lazy"} decoding="async" style="border-radius:8px;width:100%" />
          <figcaption><small>{s.cap}</small></figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </>
  ))}

  <h2>Tips for finding them</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Use an airboat, swamp buggy or seaplane.</strong> The circle is mostly water and reeds. Fly low over the circle to spot effigies from the air, then land on the marsh water. The <a href="/gta-6/map/">GTA 6 map</a> helps you plan the route.</li>
    <li><strong>Check the north half first.</strong> Two of the three are on the north side of the circle.</li>
    <li><strong>Look up.</strong> They're as tall as the trees around them, so they're easy to mistake for a trunk.</li>
    <li><strong>No reward money.</strong> It's for 100% completion and Kirk's story. The payout comes in his next quest: see the <a href="/gta-6/mr-mangrove/">Help Kirk Find Mr. Mangrove walkthrough</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>More GTA 6 help: <a href="/gta-6/collectibles/">collectibles</a>, <a href="/gta-6/missions/">full mission list</a> and <a href="/gta-6/safe-codes/">every safe code</a>.</p>
